	Obviously, to get to Hell, you must have teleport control.
Once you have that, you can level-teleport by 1) using a level
teleport trap, 2) using an uncursed or blessed scroll of teleportation
(the game is awfully picky about spellings when wishing; I don't
think wishing for a "scroll of teleport" will cut it) when you are
confused; and 3) using a cursed scroll of teleportation.
	As far as I know, that's it. If you can't do one of those
things, you may be stuck. Keep in mind that scrolls of teleportation
are randomly generated. Kill enough nasties, and maybe you'll get
lucky. 

